   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **S2: Dust in a Baggie**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Look Up, Look Down That Lonesome Road**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Fiddlin’ Around**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Scotland (3)(4)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Christmas Time’s A-Comin’ (5)**: back after 162 archived shows (1086 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Ridin’ on that Midnight Train**: back after 247 archived shows (1441 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-12-11.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 146 min [1]\n- **billystrings2022-12-11.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac16**: source not stated; 25 songs; 146 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jeri Foreman, Laura Jane Wilkie and Lisa Petticrew joined on fiddles [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-12-11.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY250/5i>Baby NBox>Sony PCM-A10 [1]\n- **billystrings2022-12-11.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY250/5i>Baby NBox>Sony PCM-A10 [2]",
